      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"I, (Annoyed Grunt)-Bot\", also known as \"\"I, D'oh-Bot\"\", is the ninth episode of \"The Simpsons\"<nowiki>'</nowiki> fifteenth season. It originally aired on the Fox network in the United States on January 11, 2004. This episode represents a milestone in the history of the series as Snowball II is killed off, which, excluding the death of Homer's mother in season 19's \"Mona Leaves-a\", is to date the closest thing to an actual Simpson family member actually being killed off.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
